Backport ROCm/AMDMIGraphX#5333 to ROCm 7.2.4.

Upstream commits:
  e96b2094ed21713ed8d27f6d143b59ae71dc3230
  a0d7ffe84e6b4cf082fb7806b861b2819a519fdb

Give TensorFlow protobuf messages and filenames unique names so that
OpenCV DNN and MIGraphX can coexist in the Immich ML worker.
The CMake hunk is adapted to the 7.2.4 protobuf link configuration.

